# Permessi sui topic per ogni tipo di client.
# read = può ricevere i messaggi del topic, write = può pubblicarci.

# Centrale operativa
user occ
topic readwrite rail/#

# Nodi stazione
user station
topic read rail/station/+/sensor/+/event
topic read rail/station/+/sensor/+/heartbeat
topic read rail/station/+/ready
topic read rail/station/+/reply/next-stop
topic read rail/station/+/cmd
topic read rail/station/+/sim
topic write rail/station/+/transit
topic write rail/station/+/heartbeat
topic write rail/station/+/status
topic write rail/station/+/fault
topic write rail/occ/request/next-stop
topic write rail/train/+/cmd

# Sensori
user sensor
topic read rail/station/+/sensor/+/detect
topic read rail/station/+/sensor/+/sim
topic write rail/station/+/sensor/+/event
topic write rail/station/+/sensor/+/heartbeat

# Treni
user train
topic read rail/train/+/cmd
topic read rail/train/+/alert
topic read rail/train/+/sim
topic write rail/station/+/sensor/+/detect
topic write rail/station/+/ready

# Script di simulazione dei guasti (sim.sh)
user sim
topic write rail/station/+/sim
topic write rail/station/+/sensor/+/sim
topic write rail/train/+/sim
